                            </svg></button></div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex-shrink-0 flex lg:justify-end"><button disabled="" title="Während eines laufenden Deployments nicht verfügbar" class="w-full lg:w-auto flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-md border transition-colors bg-panel text-fg border-strong hover:bg-line/[.04] disabled:opacity-50"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-send-icon lucide-send">
                          <path d="M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z"></path>
